		ID:           changeID,
		Created:      true,
		Cursor:       nextCursor,
		RestoredFrom: snapshotCursor,
	}, nil
}

// snapshotStateIfExistsTx returns the stored snapshot state at cursor and
// ok=true when the snapshot exists. A pruned or never-existing snapshot
